---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell
  current="matrix"
  title="matrix · motiv"
  description="matrix, the third style of @driif/motiv, is still being drawn up."
>
  <section class="site-hero">
    <p class="site-kicker">Style 02 · matrix</p>
    <h1 class="site-hero__title">Still being drawn up.</h1>
    <p class="site-hero__lede">
      matrix is the third style of motiv. It has no released components yet, so there is nothing
      here to copy. When the first one ships, it lands on this page with a live demo, the same day
      it reaches npm.
    </p>
    <div class="site-grid" aria-hidden="true">
      {Array.from({ length: 48 }, (_, index) => <span class="site-grid__cell" style={`--i: ${index}`} />)}
    </div>
    <p class="site-hero__lede">
      Until then, the <a class="site-link" href="/drawn/">drawn</a> and
      <a class="site-link" href="/motiv/">motiv</a> styles are ready to use.
    </p>
  </section>
</Shell>
